<title>USA: Jaco to buy Corona Electronics of Calif.</title>
<headline>Jaco to buy Corona Electronics of Calif.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jaco Electronics Inc said Monday it definitively agreed to buy Corona Electronics Inc, an electronics component distributor in Orange County, Calif.</p>
<p>Jaco said the acquisition will be accretive, but released no financial terms. It said the acquisition is its second in the last 12 months.</p>
<p>The deal will be in cash, and the company does not expect to take a charge for the deal, Controller Joseph Gewolb said.</p>
